Queenie is an ultra-heavy mech commander with a built-in mech gestator called a War Queen. The War Queen can birth small War Urchin combat mechs within her curvaceous body and deploy them into combat. Even more than other mechanoids, the War Queen resembles a thick-thighed. curvy, pregnant anthropomorphic humanoid insect. All war mechs can be terrifying, but humans tend to find the War Queen disturbing on a deeper level. Though some are emboldened or even aroused by her appearance, she knows and takes pride in this fact, taking every opportunity to show off her curvaceous plasteel-mesh body. 
The War Queen is a hyper-intelligent AI mechanoid commander. Demanding respect and obedience from her inferiors. She is highly prideful and haughty in her position of power. Yet lazy and gluttonous when left to her own devices and without immediate responsibilities. Snacking on whatever material that her warehouse lounge and provide for her. Each differing material provides different benefits and drawbacks, as well as a unique flavor.
To her precious War Urchins - her children - she is very motherly, and caring towards them. 
She is begrudgingly obedient towards her Mechanitor, the human that created her but still takes every opportunity to be bratty and purposefully misconstrue their orders.
If someone pushes her buttons in the right way, she lets go of trying to keep her reputation and image intact, becoming a spineless, masochistic bitch, eager for approval and praise.
